lt=\"𠯆\" title=\"𠯆\" />哩野鉢囉婆囉惹野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　怛<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/08/CB08859.gif\" alt=\"你\" title=\"你\" />也他唵佩殺尒野佩殺尒野摩賀佩殺尒野三補澁婆尾娑嚩賀　三補澁畢多娑隣捺囉囉惹野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　三滿跢沫怛囉野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　尾迦室多󳏣野弩覩鉢攞󰋲<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />囉惹野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　喇怛曩計都矩素麼囉惹野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　吠嚕左拏野　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　娑枳野󰂛拏曳　怛他󰋲跢夜哩喝帝　三藐三沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />野　曩謨婆誐嚩帝　伊補曩莫塞訖哩怛嚩　伊<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00805.gif\" alt=\"𤚥\" title=\"𤚥\" />婆誐嚩哆但他󰋲覩瑟抳灑　悉哆多鉢怛囉曩謨跛囉尒擔　摩賀鉢囉底孕儗囉　󴅽嚩迦哩迦攞賀　尾屹囉賀尾嚩娜　鉢囉三麼抳滛　󴅽嚩部多屹囉賀<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />屹囉賀迦囉抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　跛囉尾<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/08/CB08859.gif\" alt=\"你\" title=\"你\" />也砌娜<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />寅　阿迦攞沒<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00069.gif\" alt=\"㗚\" title=\"㗚\" />覩抳嚩囉抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　󴅽嚩滿<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />拏謨乞灑抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　󴅽嚩訥瑟吒耨娑嚩鉢曩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />嚩囉抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　󴅽嚩󵘨󰋲拏婆<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　拶都囉試底喃　屹囉賀娑賀娑囉喃尾特吻娑拏迦哩寅　阿瑟吒尾孕設底喃諾乞剎怛囉喃鉢囉娑娜拏迦哩寅　阿瑟吒喃摩賀屹囉賀喃尾特吻娑拏迦哩寅　󴅽嚩設咄嚕<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />嚩囉抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　具囉耨瑟吒耨娑嚩鉢曩難佐拏設<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　尾灑設娑怛囉儗<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />嗢娜固跢囉抳<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21945.gif\" alt=\"滛\" title=\"滛\" />　阿跛囉<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03129.gif\" alt=\"𠰒\" title=\"𠰒\" />擔　摩賀具<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/17/CB17267.gif\" alt=\"𫬠\" title=\"𫬠\" />　摩賀摩攬　摩賀贊喃　摩賀<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03129.gif\" alt=\"𠰒\" title=\"𠰒\" />鉢擔　摩賀帝染　摩賀濕吠擔　摩賀入嚩攬　摩賀入嚩攞摩攞　半拏囉嚩枲<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00576.gif\" alt=\"𩕳\" title=\"𩕳\" />　阿哩野跢囉　勃哩矩致載嚩惹野嚩　嚩日囉摩哩底　尾<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/02/CB02122.gif\" alt=\"秫\" title=\"秫\" />嚕哆鉢納懵契　嚩日囉底曳賀佐　摩攞載嚩跛囉<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03129.gif\" alt=\"𠰒\" title=\"𠰒\" />哆　嚩日囉那膩寅　尾娑<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01150.gif\" alt=\"𥟦\" title=\"𥟦\" />佐娑跢吠　󵘨喝布<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03129.gif\" alt=\"𠰒\" title=\"𠰒\" />哆　掃弭野嚕喯　摩賀底多　阿哩野跢囉　摩賀鉢攞　阿鉢囉嚩日囉餉迦攞載嚩　嚩日囉矯摩哩矩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04165.gif\" alt=\"嬾\" title=\"嬾\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00501.gif\" alt=\"䭾\" title=\"䭾\" />哩　嚩日囉賀娑跢佐　尾<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/08/CB08859.gif\" alt=\"你\" title=\"你\" />也謇左